s://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cotton_tree_in_Freetown,_SL_-_Mapillary_(yIBZ74r6IsUFOaWtAPwhWw).jpg"}},{"id":"freetown_wv_portuguese_steps","areaId":"freetown","name":"Portuguese steps","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":8.49095,"lng":-13.23605},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"freetown_wv_portuguese_steps","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":1,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["portuguesesteps","freetown"],"summary":"These steps connect the lower Commissariat at the landing area to the French Company building on Wallance Johnson street. Despite their name, it was the British colonial governor Sir Charles MacCarthy who had them constructed in 1818; the Portuguese colonised this area but not longer when the steps were built.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Freetown","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/St._George%E2%80%99s_Cathedral%2C_Freetown%2C_Sierra_Leone_-_Mapillary_%28knEmjjqEzIEdwdIuZDjOtA%29.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/74/St._George%E2%80%99s_Cathedral%2C_Freetown%2C_Sierra_Leone_-_Mapillary_%28knEmjjqEzIEdwdIuZDjOtA%29.jpg","w":1200,"h":785,"author":"danbjoseph @ Mapillary.com","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:St._George%E2%80%99s_Cathedral,_Freetown,_Sierra_Leone_-_Mapillary_(knEmjjqEzIEdwdIuZDjOtA).jpg"}},{"id":"freetown_wv_sierra_leone_peace_museum","areaId":"freetown","name":"Sierra Leone Peace Museum","category":"museum","tags":["museums"],"location":{"lat":8.47123,"lng":-13.24254},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"freetown_wv_sierra_leone_peace_museum","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.sierraleonetrc.org/index.php/sierra-leone-peace-museum","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["sierraleonepeacemuseum","freetown"],"hours":{"week":[null,{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Closed Mon; Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Dedicated to telling the story of Sierra Leone's decade-long conflict and reconciliation. Features interactive displays that illustrate the chronology of the conflict and the ensuing peace process, with galleries, photos, and a memorial garden. The Human Rights Commission is one of the stakeholders in the organization.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Freetown"},{"id":"freetown_wv_lumley_beach","areaId":"freetown","name":"Lumley Beach","category":"beach","tags":["beach","sea","nature","sunset"],"location":{"lat":8.4806,"lng":-13.2862},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"freetown_wv_lumley_beach","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["lumleybeach","freetown"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"The main public beach and rubbish dump close to Freetown itself facing the Atlantic with shops, restaurants, hotels, golf course, as well as local clubs. The beach is popular for football, running and is normally crowded on holidays and the weekend. A paved pathway now runs the length of the beach, popular for walking and jogging, especially when the tide is in. Avoid the Aberdeen end which is cov","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Freetown"},{"id":"freetown_wv_goderich_beach","areaId":"freetown","name":"Goderich Beach","category":"beach","tags":["beach","sea","nature","sunset"],"location":{"lat":8.4385,"lng":-13.281},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"freetown_wv_goderich_beach","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["goderichbeach","freetown"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"Goderich is not known for its beach, most people drive past on the way to other beaches. Anywhere else, this would be a top attraction.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Freetown"},{"id":"freetown_wv_freetown_golf_club","areaId":"freetown","name":"Freetown Golf Club","category":"beach","tags":["beach","sea","nature","sunset"],"location":{"lat":8.4633,"lng":-13.2772},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"freetown_wv_freetown_golf_club","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://golf.sl/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":0,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-22"},"hashtags":["freetowngolfclub","freetown"],"bestLight":"sunset","summary":"A round of golf or tennis at the club just off the beach at Lumley.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"Freetown"},{"id":"freetown_wv_mamba_point_restaurant_at_lagoonda","areaId":"freetown","name":"Mamba Point Restaurant at Lagoonda","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":8.4962,"lng":-13.2943},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"freetown_wv_mamba_point_restaurant_at_lagoonda","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["mambapointrestaurantatlagoonda","freetown"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Refurbished to a high standard in 2015. The people behind this came from the Mamba Point at Wilberforce which is now the Hub. They brought the staff, great food and name with them. It is rated as one of the best restaurants in Freetown. Arrive early and sit on the terrace with the best view over Man o'war bay. They also have a smart air conditioned indoor section. The Lagoonda Casino is upstairs.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Freetown"},{"id":"freetown_wv_chapter_one","areaId":"freetown","name":"Chapter One","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":8.46059,"lng":-13.27879},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"freetown_wv_chapter_one","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://chapterone.sl/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["chapterone","freetown"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"An impressive entertainment complex built on the site of the former Atlantic Restaurant, opposite the golf club. The modern complex houses a restaurant, nightclub and bar. If you want to go to one of their special events, you could pay $100 per person for entry.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Freetown"},{"id":"freetown_wv_country_lodge_hotel_restaurant","areaId":"freetown","name":"Country Lodge Hotel Restaurant","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":8.4567,"lng":-13.2561},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"freetown_wv_country_lodge_hotel_restaurant","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.countrylodgesl.com/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["countrylodgehotelrestaurant","freetown"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"HS 51 Hill Station. Excellent views over the city, live jazz on Thursdays. The peppercrust stake is very good, Mongolian night every Friday","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Freetown"},{"id":"freetown_wv_indochine_restaurant","areaId":"freetown","na